  "description": "Abundance maps of FeO, TiO2, Al2O3, CaO, MgO and SiO2 (wt%) and Mg# between 65N and 65S, inverted from Kaguya Multiband Imager reflectance with a residual 1D CNN trained on Apollo, Luna, and Chang'E samples including Chang'e-6 (Shi et al. 2026). 512 ppd (59 m/pixel), Simple Cylindrical, registered to the LRO frame. Distributed as 9 GeoTIFFs per product; each COG joins them in IAU:30100.",
